      "content": "The argument that Quisling's collaboration was a necessary evil is a dangerous historical revisionism that ignores the fact that he actively sought to appease the Nazis rather than protect his people. His regime was built on collaboration with the very forces that committed the Holocaust, and he used the excuse of \"order\" to justify the deportation of thousands of Norwegians to concentration camps. True leadership requires resisting occupation, not signing away sovereignty to become a puppet ruler who facilitated the destruction of his own nation.",
